gold_text:
\begin{mclaim} \label{mclmpreservation}
  Assume $\mathsf{AD}$ and let $G\subseteq\mathbb{M}_{\aleph_1\aleph_2}$ be $V$-generic.
  Then $\aleph_{\omega+1}$ is regular in $V[G]$.
\end{mclaim}

